---
layout: base
title: Services
permalink: /services/
description: "One accountable team for your local business's website, accessibility, booking automation, Google listing, custom AI tools and everyday tech questions."
---

{# Services come from src/_data/services.js; related package names and prices from src/_data/packages.js. #}

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow mb-4">Services</p>
    <h1 class="h-section mb-4 md:text-5xl">One team for all of your business's tech</h1>
    <p class="lede max-w-2xl">Most local businesses juggle a web designer, a booking tool, a texting service and a cousin who "does computers." We replace that pile with one accountable team. Here is what we take care of.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section pt-0 md:pt-0" aria-label="Our services">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
      {% for s in services %}
      <article id="{{ s.id }}" class="card flex scroll-mt-24 flex-col">
        <h2 class="mt-3 text-2xl font-medium text-gray-900">{{ s.name }}</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-gray-700">{{ s.summary }}</p>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-800">
          {% for b in s.bullets %}
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">{% include "partials/check-icon.njk" %}<span>{{ b }}</span></li>
          {% endfor %}
        </ul>
        {% for p in packages.all %}{% if p.id == s.package %}
        <p class="mt-auto pt-6 text-sm text-gray-800">Related package: <a href="/pricing/#{{ p.id }}" class="link font-medium">{{ p.name }}, {{ p.price }}{% if p in packages.monthly %} {{ p.priceNote }}{% endif %}</a></p>
        {% endif %}{% endfor %}
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section bg-gray-50" aria-labelledby="how-we-work-heading">
  <div class="wrap-narrow">
    <h2 id="how-we-work-heading" class="h-section mb-6">How we work with you</h2>
    <ol class="space-y-5 text-gray-800">
      <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
        <span aria-hidden="true" class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-gulf-700 font-medium text-white">1</span>
        <p><strong class="text-gray-900">Free checkup.</strong> A 20-minute call and a written scan of your website, booking flow and Google listing.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
        <span aria-hidden="true" class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-gulf-700 font-medium text-white">2</span>
        <p><strong class="text-gray-900">Fixed-price plan.</strong> You get a plain-English plan with a price in writing. Nothing starts until you say yes.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
        <span aria-hidden="true" class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-gulf-700 font-medium text-white">3</span>
        <p><strong class="text-gray-900">We build it.</strong> We do the work, test it the way your customers will use it, and show you how it runs.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
        <span aria-hidden="true" class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-gulf-700 font-medium text-white">4</span>
        <p><strong class="text-gray-900">Ongoing partner.</strong> If you want us to keep an eye on things, a monthly plan covers checkups, changes and questions. It is month-to-month.</p>
      </li>
    </ol>
    <p class="mt-8 text-gray-800">Prices are on the <a href="/pricing/" class="link">packages and pricing page</a>.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section band-dark on-dark text-center">
  <div class="wrap-narrow">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-medium text-white md:text-4xl">Not sure where to start?</h2>
    <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-xl text-lg text-gray-100">Book the free checkup. We look at your site, your booking flow and your Google listing, and tell you what to fix first.</p>
    <p class="mt-8"><a href="{{ site.writeupCta.href }}" class="btn-light">Get my free website write-up</a></p>
  </div>
</section>
